# Admin List Export — One Shared Visual System

All Admin LIST exports must reuse the shared report chrome (PDF + print).

## Shared across every list

- page margins, brand header, Generated / Generated By
- report-title typography, burgundy accent
- filter-summary, table-header, body typography, row separators
- footer (Confidential | page number | Rosewood Royale)
- page numbering (never Page 0)
- multi-page header repetition
- landscape sheet fills printable area (`width: 100%`); never combine full-paper mm sheet width with `@page` margins

## May vary per module only

- report title
- active filters
- table columns
- `columns[].width`
- `columns[].align`

Do not invent a per-module PDF visual design or hardcode field-name CSS in the shared template.
